question:
What pattern does this implement?
```java
class Singleton {
  private static Singleton instance;
  private Singleton() { }
  public static Singleton getInstance() {
    if (instance == null) {
      instance = new Singleton();
    }
    return instance;
  }
}
```

Which is a thread-safe Singleton implementation?
```java
class Singleton {
  private static volatile Singleton instance;
  private Singleton() { }
  public static Singleton getInstance() {
    if (instance == null) {
      synchronized (Singleton.class) {
        if (instance == null) {
          instance = new Singleton();
        }
      }
    }
    return instance;
  }
}
```

